{"id":"en_a-washed-up-veteran-saved-the-world","title":"A Washed-Up Veteran Saved the World","titleEn":"A Washed-Up Veteran Saved the World","description":"For a decade, Jack Ralli has cut himself off from the world, grieving the family he lost. That solitude ends when Annie, the daughter of a man he once served alongside, reaches out in desperation. A drug cartel has taken her captive, and its members are after a classified military device with the power to bend human minds. Rescuing her means Jack must revive the merciless fighter he left behind. Yet each step toward Annie exposes a wider scheme, until Jack suspects the cartel answers to someone else — perhaps someone from the circle he trusted during his service.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/a-washed-up-veteran-saved-the-world/en_US/c69ae2d39bc7c269/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/a-washed-up-veteran-saved-the-world/en_US/c69ae2d39bc7c269/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds2vm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_a-washed-up-veteran-saved-the-world_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds2vm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_a-washed-up-veteran-saved-the-world_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds2vm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_a-washed-up-veteran-saved-the-world_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds2vm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_a-washed-up-veteran-saved-the-world_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":